      "Final 480x320/12 ms guest: baseline 59.7274 presentations/s versus candidate 98.0526, with approximately 59.73 guest frames/s in both. Optional counts remain sensitive to observed work cost and host scheduling.",
      "Final light 480x320/2 ms guest: baseline 118.9541 presentations/s versus candidate 117.4640. The baseline was already near the native doubled rate; this is not a universal increase in presentation count.",
      "Final 60 mode: baseline 59.7279 versus candidate 59.2298 presentations/s in this sample, despite neither path attempting optional images. Earlier rounds measured approximately 59.73 in both. Retain the measured dip; these aggregate records cannot attribute individual host scheduling delays.",
