      "Final 2400x1080/12 ms guest: both versions admitted no optional images; baseline guest cadence59.6627, candidate59.4610. Earlier quiet-round values were approximately59.73 in both.",
      "These results support removal of the structural half-period execution limit and correction of the known stale-budget defect. They do not establish120 FPS on the user phone."
